  "settings.restoredOk": "Kaabta waa la soo dejiyay Macaamiisha/ miisaaniyadaha tirada taariikhda faylka waa la cusboonaysiiyay; Taariikhaha kale ee taleefankan ayaa lagu hayay.",
  "settings.restoreFailed": "Faylkaasi uma eka mid kaydka jeebka Pulse oo sax ah.",
